WEBVTT

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:02.910
The Digital World,

00:00:02.910 --> 00:00:06.100
a world inhabited by unusual 
creatures called Digimon.

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:09.950
It has been conquered 
by the evil Bagra Army

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:14.480
and divided into seven Kingdoms 
ruled by seven Death Generals.

00:00:15.230 --> 00:00:18.250
Taiki Kudou has leapt into 
these seven Kingdoms

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:22.030
along with his partner, Shoutmon, 
to save the Digimon.

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:25.680
This is the story of the 
friendship and adventures

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:28.540
shared by Taiki, his friends, 
and the Digimon.

00:01:57.450 --> 00:02:00.630
The Digital World has been 
divided into seven Kingdoms,

00:02:00.630 --> 00:02:04.540
ruled by the seven strongest generals 
around, the Death Generals.

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:08.270
The ruler of the first 
Kingdom, Dragon Land,

00:02:08.270 --> 00:02:10.610
Dorbickmon the Fire Fury, 
is unbelievably strong.

00:02:11.460 --> 00:02:14.980
Worse yet, now they have 
the power to DigiXros, too!

00:02:17.920 --> 00:02:26.490
<b>Stand Up, Kiriha!</b>

00:02:19.020 --> 00:02:26.490
<b>Xros Heart's Rescue Strategy</b>

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:24.490
Stand Up, Kiriha! 
Xros Heart's Rescue Strategy!

00:02:26.490 --> 00:02:29.150
Huanglongmon, time to DigiXros.

00:02:29.150 --> 00:02:30.800
Understood.

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:33.930
He's not hurt?

00:02:33.930 --> 00:02:35.350
DigiXros!

00:02:46.150 --> 00:02:49.780
Dorbickmon Darkness Mode!

00:02:58.120 --> 00:02:59.420
<i>He's strong.</i>

00:02:59.420 --> 00:03:01.930
<i>So I can't beat him 
even after Digivolving?</i>

00:03:01.930 --> 00:03:05.330
OmegaShoutmon's getting 
completely trampled.

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:08.530
That is Dorbickmon's true power.

00:03:08.530 --> 00:03:11.380
He doesn't just manipulate 
the surrounding terrain.

00:03:11.380 --> 00:03:14.140
His strength alone is extraordinary.

00:03:14.140 --> 00:03:15.540
This is the end.

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:18.480
Dragon Breath Tonic Fire!

00:03:22.850 --> 00:03:23.650
Shoutmon!

00:03:30.010 --> 00:03:31.860
The Digivolution wore off!

00:03:31.860 --> 00:03:33.400
Digivolution?

00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:35.860
You are indeed a dragon with potential.

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:39.600
How about ditching Taiki 
Kudou and serving me?

00:03:40.070 --> 00:03:42.530
If you do that, I'll spare your life.

00:03:44.470 --> 00:03:46.200
Much as I appreciate the offer...

00:03:48.140 --> 00:03:49.740
The answer is no!

00:03:49.740 --> 00:03:53.250
Who would take orders 
from a tyrant like you?!

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:55.730
That's right!

00:03:55.730 --> 00:03:57.580
Shoutmon's gonna become the King

00:03:57.580 --> 00:04:00.360
and turn the Digital World 
into a bright, cheerful place!

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:01.140
Taiki...

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:03.500
Interesting.

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:06.880
The ideal answer for a foolish rebel.

00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:10.200
Then you will die in vain!

00:04:11.330 --> 00:04:11.960
Taiki!

00:04:15.590 --> 00:04:17.220
Wh-What is this?

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:21.310
It can't be...

00:04:21.310 --> 00:04:22.910
Weeping Dragon flowers?

00:04:22.910 --> 00:04:24.680
Precisely!

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:30.320
Pollen Hurricane!

00:04:34.350 --> 00:04:36.620
C-Curses...

00:04:39.290 --> 00:04:41.130
He's acting weird.

00:04:47.400 --> 00:04:50.310
The pollen is paralyzing him.

00:04:50.310 --> 00:04:50.900
Who are you?

00:04:51.300 --> 00:04:53.200
I'm Ohanamon.

00:04:53.200 --> 00:04:55.210
Why, you...

00:04:55.210 --> 00:04:56.240
It's no use.

00:05:03.850 --> 00:05:07.120
Blast it! They're...

00:05:08.920 --> 00:05:10.760
It's Sparrowmon!

00:05:10.760 --> 00:05:12.720
You saved us!

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:15.320
Wait, that means...

00:05:15.320 --> 00:05:16.690
Precisely.

00:05:21.550 --> 00:05:22.650
It's me.

00:05:23.270 --> 00:05:24.770
Nene!

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:32.700
Welcome back, Taiki. 
I've been waiting for you.

00:05:32.700 --> 00:05:34.410
Thanks, Nene.

00:05:34.410 --> 00:05:37.300
Why were you dressed 
as a Digimon, anyway?

00:05:37.300 --> 00:05:40.520
So I could blend into this Kingdom 
and do some investigating,

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:42.330
to learn their weaknesses

00:05:42.330 --> 00:05:44.690
and the whereabouts of 
the Xros Heart Digimon.

00:05:44.690 --> 00:05:48.430
I planned to fight alongside 
Kiriha once I'd found all that.

00:05:48.430 --> 00:05:50.410
And these flowers were the result?

00:05:50.410 --> 00:05:52.670
Yeah. I heard a rumor

00:05:52.670 --> 00:05:54.940
that dragons collapse here, 
on Weeping Dragon Mountain.

00:05:54.940 --> 00:05:57.710
That's great! 
We've found their weakness!

00:05:57.710 --> 00:05:59.140
I don't know about that.

00:05:59.140 --> 00:06:03.140
I don't think the same trick will work 
on Dorbickmon over and over.

00:06:03.140 --> 00:06:03.940
Kiriha...

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:08.010
A message to all citizens 
of Dragon Land.

00:06:09.230 --> 00:06:12.070
The rebels being held 
in space-time stasis

00:06:12.070 --> 00:06:14.520
will be publicly executed at dawn.

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:17.620
These are the rebels: Xros Heart!

00:06:20.760 --> 00:06:21.990
Guys!

00:06:21.990 --> 00:06:24.000
So they were captured by Dorbickmon!

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:27.680
The execution will be held 
here, at Dragon Falls.

00:06:27.680 --> 00:06:29.670
It will be the end for these fools

00:06:29.670 --> 00:06:31.740
who dared to defy the 
great Lord Bagramon.

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:34.400
I suggest you give it 
your full attention.

00:06:40.720 --> 00:06:42.180
You saw it.

00:06:42.180 --> 00:06:45.030
There's too much moisture in 
the air around that waterfall.

00:06:45.030 --> 00:06:46.120
Pollen won't work.

00:06:46.120 --> 00:06:48.620
And I still can't use my Digimon.

00:06:48.620 --> 00:06:51.300
The only ones we have who 
can fight are Shoutmon,

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:52.640
Sparrowmon, and the Monitamons.

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:54.290
There's no way we can win.

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:55.780
No.

00:06:56.570 --> 00:06:58.470
It's too soon to give up.

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:11.630
I can't believe the entire 
Xros Heart team was arrested.

00:07:11.630 --> 00:07:13.910
And Blue Flare keeps losing.

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:15.770
We have no hopes or dreams left.

00:07:23.760 --> 00:07:27.060
I want to ask you about that waterfall.

00:07:31.330 --> 00:07:34.330
It's exactly where you 
suspected it was, Taiki.

00:07:34.330 --> 00:07:35.300
Really?

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:37.220
What do you think, Dracomon?

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:39.210
Okay. I'll try.

00:07:39.210 --> 00:07:40.440
Hold it!

00:07:40.440 --> 00:07:45.090
Taiki, do you really intend to center 
our battle strategy around him?

00:07:45.090 --> 00:07:46.080
Yeah.

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:48.460
Are you nuts?! He's weak!

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:50.600
You...

00:07:50.600 --> 00:07:52.620
It doesn't matter if he's weak.

00:07:52.620 --> 00:07:53.630
What?

00:07:53.630 --> 00:07:55.950
Dracomon has the will to fight.

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:57.380
That's enough.

00:07:57.380 --> 00:07:59.510
Besides, he knows the 
geography of this area.

00:08:00.490 --> 00:08:03.190
He saved us with that 
knowledge today, didn't he?

00:08:06.680 --> 00:08:08.630
Then this alliance is over.

00:08:08.630 --> 00:08:11.680
I can't work with a naive fool who 
dotes on a weakling like him.

00:08:23.410 --> 00:08:26.820
You're not being honest, Kiriha.

00:08:28.130 --> 00:08:29.820
What are you talking about?

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:32.940
You waited all that time 
for Taiki to come back.

00:08:34.530 --> 00:08:38.670
I thought, if he came back, 
it would turn the tides.

00:08:38.670 --> 00:08:40.600
And I was right.

00:08:41.270 --> 00:08:43.530
They haven't mastered it fully yet,

00:08:43.530 --> 00:08:47.910
but Taiki and Shoutmon returned 
with the ability to Digivolve.

00:08:49.210 --> 00:08:50.790
Digivolve?

00:08:50.790 --> 00:08:52.520
I haven't seen it yet.

00:08:52.520 --> 00:08:54.850
How is he able to do that?

00:08:56.310 --> 00:08:59.410
All I know is that I can't do it.

00:08:59.860 --> 00:09:01.450
Right now...

00:09:01.800 --> 00:09:03.050
I don't have the strength.

00:09:08.040 --> 00:09:10.500
Weakness is evil.

00:09:12.700 --> 00:09:15.950
You're frustrated that you can't 
forgive yourself, aren't you?

00:09:20.770 --> 00:09:23.610
I can't say I dislike that about you.

00:09:23.610 --> 00:09:27.050
Because I know you'll become stronger.

00:09:35.730 --> 00:09:38.020
Look, Huanglongmon.

00:09:38.020 --> 00:09:40.430
We have the water dragon 
troops in the water,

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:42.610
the fire dragon troops 
surrounding the waterfall,

00:09:43.280 --> 00:09:45.570
and the flying dragon troops in the air.

00:09:45.570 --> 00:09:46.530
What's more...

00:09:46.530 --> 00:09:49.060
Pollen won't work since 
the waterfall is nearby.

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:50.160
We've left no openings.

00:09:50.160 --> 00:09:53.820
It would take a real hero or a 
real idiot to try to interfere.

00:09:54.810 --> 00:09:59.370
I will crush those pests who defied 
my Kingdom with my own hands.

00:09:59.370 --> 00:10:00.580
Thoroughly!

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:14.760
The Blue Flare General...

00:10:15.750 --> 00:10:18.220
You're here to yell at 
me again, aren't you,

00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:20.550
for being so persistent, 
even though I'm weak?

00:10:21.670 --> 00:10:25.780
No. You are stronger than I am.

00:10:25.780 --> 00:10:26.400
What?

00:10:26.400 --> 00:10:29.020
If I were in your position,

00:10:29.020 --> 00:10:31.920
I don't think I could 
do what you're doing.

00:10:31.920 --> 00:10:33.710
How can you do all this?

00:10:34.950 --> 00:10:36.500
I don't know.

00:10:36.950 --> 00:10:40.950
But even if I'm weak, 
I have my pride as a dragon.

00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:43.920
Your pride as a dragon?

00:10:43.920 --> 00:10:45.550
It's true, isn't it?

00:10:45.550 --> 00:10:48.230
If dragons are the strongest Digimon,

00:10:48.230 --> 00:10:51.230
we should protect all the 
other Digimon in the Kingdom.

00:10:51.230 --> 00:10:53.830
That's why Dorbickmon is wrong.

00:10:53.830 --> 00:10:57.870
I want to help everyone 
who's fighting against him.

00:11:08.210 --> 00:11:09.800
Pride...

00:11:11.450 --> 00:11:14.550
The pride of a dragon, huh?

00:11:15.080 --> 00:11:16.620
Let's fight, Kiriha.

00:11:17.750 --> 00:11:18.980
Greymon?

00:11:18.980 --> 00:11:21.350
But you still haven't recovered from...

00:11:21.350 --> 00:11:24.630
How can we rest after 
hearing what he said?

00:11:24.630 --> 00:11:25.130
That's right.

00:11:28.190 --> 00:11:29.590
But...

00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:04.610
You can't even use your 
abilities in that cage.

00:12:06.340 --> 00:12:09.270
That's the jerk who sealed us in here!

00:12:09.270 --> 00:12:13.920
Even if we fall, Taiki will 
return and destroy you!

00:12:13.920 --> 00:12:15.400
Yeah!

00:12:15.400 --> 00:12:16.660
Wouldn't that be nice?

00:12:20.120 --> 00:12:20.930
Taiki!

00:12:20.930 --> 00:12:21.550
Shoutmon!

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:22.570
Guys!

00:12:22.570 --> 00:12:23.520
We're gonna save you now!

00:12:23.520 --> 00:12:25.060
That won't happen.

00:12:25.060 --> 00:12:28.410
Breaking through the defenses 
surrounding this area

00:12:28.410 --> 00:12:31.160
and defeating me, with your 
strength, is impossible.

00:12:31.160 --> 00:12:32.550
You're right.

00:12:32.550 --> 00:12:34.010
But we will get our friends back!

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:36.070
And how will you do that?

00:12:36.070 --> 00:12:37.130
By...

00:12:41.240 --> 00:12:42.770
...doing this!

00:12:50.210 --> 00:12:51.250
What?!

00:13:00.440 --> 00:13:01.690
What the...

00:13:01.690 --> 00:13:03.570
We have Dracomon to thank!

00:13:03.570 --> 00:13:04.700
Dracomon?

00:13:04.700 --> 00:13:05.890
That's right.

00:13:09.630 --> 00:13:10.860
He pinpointed the one spot

00:13:10.860 --> 00:13:12.750
that could bring down 
the whole waterfall,

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:14.670
and planted a bomb there.

00:13:14.990 --> 00:13:19.880
All behind a camouflage screen 
projected by Hi-VisionMonitamon.

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:22.530
That scrawny little dragon did that?

00:13:22.530 --> 00:13:23.500
Why, you...

00:13:27.350 --> 00:13:29.470
Handmade missiles.

00:13:29.470 --> 00:13:31.070
With the pollen packed inside,

00:13:31.070 --> 00:13:33.160
it'll work even when close to water.

00:13:34.530 --> 00:13:36.080
Curse you!

00:13:36.660 --> 00:13:37.860
So long!

00:13:42.030 --> 00:13:43.840
Y-You won't get away with this!

00:13:45.000 --> 00:13:47.170
I'll DigiXros with my whole army!

00:14:03.610 --> 00:14:05.860
Taiki! I knew you'd come back!

00:14:05.860 --> 00:14:06.890
Brother!

00:14:06.890 --> 00:14:09.060
Yeah, I know, I know...

00:14:09.060 --> 00:14:09.710
He's coming.

00:14:10.400 --> 00:14:11.530
Dorbickmon!

00:14:11.530 --> 00:14:13.230
You will not escape!

00:14:13.650 --> 00:14:15.800
Everyone get in the Xros Loader for now!

00:14:24.510 --> 00:14:27.220
Are you all okay to DigiXros?

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:28.370
Of course!

00:14:28.370 --> 00:14:29.520
All right!

00:14:42.960 --> 00:14:44.300
Shoutmon!

00:14:44.300 --> 00:14:45.700
Okay!

00:14:45.700 --> 00:14:47.030
Ballistamon!

00:14:48.330 --> 00:14:49.600
Dorulumon!

00:14:51.040 --> 00:14:51.800
Starmons!

00:14:51.800 --> 00:14:53.270
Yes!

00:14:54.170 --> 00:14:55.490
Sparrowmon!

00:14:56.340 --> 00:14:57.580
Beelzebumon!

00:14:58.980 --> 00:15:00.750
DigiXros!

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:02.650
DigiXros!

00:15:09.890 --> 00:15:12.940
Shoutmon X5B!

00:15:31.180 --> 00:15:32.380
I can't move...

00:15:33.140 --> 00:15:36.450
Dragon Breath Tonic Fire!

00:15:40.720 --> 00:15:42.090
X5B!

00:15:44.570 --> 00:15:46.180
Serves you right.

00:15:47.770 --> 00:15:50.830
But before I finish all of you...

00:15:51.830 --> 00:15:52.680
Dracomon!

00:15:54.630 --> 00:15:57.180
This is the fate that 
awaits you, weakling!

00:15:59.540 --> 00:16:00.840
Stop!

00:16:02.230 --> 00:16:05.000
Go ahead and plead for your life.

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:06.380
N-No!

00:16:06.880 --> 00:16:08.650
I may be weak,

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:10.550
but I'll never do that!

00:16:11.110 --> 00:16:12.980
Then you can disappear!

00:16:25.030 --> 00:16:27.900
The Blue Flare General!

00:16:27.900 --> 00:16:29.630
My name is Kiriha.

00:16:29.630 --> 00:16:31.310
Don't forget it, Dracomon.

00:16:32.740 --> 00:16:34.510
What are you trying to pull?

00:16:34.510 --> 00:16:37.010
You don't have the strength to fight me!

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:41.050
I don't have the strength, 
but there's one thing I have left.

00:16:41.880 --> 00:16:43.150
My pride.

00:16:43.150 --> 00:16:44.130
What?

00:16:44.850 --> 00:16:47.290
Go, MetalGreymon!

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:50.390
Trident Arm!

00:16:53.290 --> 00:16:55.050
Kiriha is back!

00:16:55.050 --> 00:16:55.630
Yeah!

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:03.230
Take this!

00:17:08.270 --> 00:17:11.510
This is no place for weaklings like you!

00:17:16.310 --> 00:17:17.450
MetalGreymon!

00:17:23.720 --> 00:17:24.560
Kiriha!

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:25.860
Stay back!

00:17:27.310 --> 00:17:29.430
Get up, MetalGreymon!

00:17:30.680 --> 00:17:32.670
Remember what Dracomon taught us.

00:17:33.310 --> 00:17:35.180
If you want to be strong,

00:17:35.180 --> 00:17:38.540
the first thing you need 
is unwavering pride!

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:41.770
And this is our pride!

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:47.410
Kiriha...

00:17:48.110 --> 00:17:51.560
Don't make me laugh! This is the end!

00:18:00.590 --> 00:18:03.440
Tyrant Collbrande!

00:18:08.930 --> 00:18:09.950
We're not finished yet!

00:18:09.950 --> 00:18:11.800
That's not enough to break us!

00:18:11.800 --> 00:18:17.140
No rotten-hearted dragon 
can break our pride!

00:18:24.980 --> 00:18:26.880
You can do it!

00:18:26.880 --> 00:18:31.490
You can do it, Blue Flare!

00:18:38.800 --> 00:18:40.910
That's the best you can do?

00:18:44.770 --> 00:18:45.880
What?

00:18:52.780 --> 00:18:53.880
What is this?

00:18:59.030 --> 00:19:02.080
Kiriha! That's the 
power of Digivolution!

00:19:02.080 --> 00:19:03.910
Raise your Xros Loader!

00:19:05.320 --> 00:19:07.030
Digivolution?

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:08.510
All right!

00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:10.900
MetalGreymon!

00:19:10.900 --> 00:19:12.380
Digivolve!

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:24.210
ZekeGreymon!

00:19:25.380 --> 00:19:27.350
Digivolution?

00:19:28.810 --> 00:19:31.120
Digivolve all you want.

00:19:31.120 --> 00:19:34.030
You'll still never be a match for me!

00:19:35.170 --> 00:19:36.720
How do you like that?!

00:19:42.790 --> 00:19:43.960
What?!

00:19:44.600 --> 00:19:45.830
In that case...

00:19:48.430 --> 00:19:50.180
I'll smash you into the ground!

00:19:50.840 --> 00:19:54.240
Destroy Smasher!

00:20:02.100 --> 00:20:04.720
It can't be! My attack...

00:20:05.320 --> 00:20:07.290
Go, ZekeGreymon!

00:20:12.570 --> 00:20:15.640
Final Strikes!

00:20:18.560 --> 00:20:21.330
This can't be!

00:20:24.800 --> 00:20:26.440
All right!

00:20:50.460 --> 00:20:52.580
That's the path to the next Kingdom.

00:20:52.580 --> 00:20:55.600
So the path opens when a 
Death General is defeated.

00:20:55.600 --> 00:20:58.000
If we defeat all seven generals,

00:20:58.000 --> 00:21:00.440
we can get to Bagramon.

00:21:01.630 --> 00:21:03.740
Don't make me laugh.

00:21:03.740 --> 00:21:07.760
If you struggled so much against me, 
the ruler of the first Kingdom,

00:21:07.760 --> 00:21:11.750
you won't stand a chance against 
the generals you'll face after this.

00:21:23.530 --> 00:21:26.860
Well, anyway, I'm glad 
everyone's together now!

00:21:26.860 --> 00:21:29.210
So, Lillymon will join Xros Heart,

00:21:29.210 --> 00:21:32.580
and Dracomon can join Blue Flare, okay?

00:21:32.580 --> 00:21:33.670
Hold on.

